@startuml brukerhistorie2Sekvensdiagram
hide footbox

title Brukerhistorie 2 - Foreleser leser anmeldelser av faget sitt

actor "Foreleser" as User
box "JavaFX-klient" #F1EFE8
participant "HomeController\n(ui)" as HomeC
participant "Navigation\n(ui)" as Nav
participant "CourseSelectionController\n(ui)" as SelectC
participant "ReadReviewsController\n(ui)" as ReadC
participant "BackgroundTaskRunner\n(ui)" as Runner
participant "ReviewService\n(core)" as ClientService
participant "RemoteReviewRepository\n(ui)" as Remote
end box
box "REST-server" #FAECE7
participant "CourseController\n(rest)" as CourseC
participant "ReviewService\n(core)" as ServerService
participant "ReviewHandler\n(file)" as Handler
database "courses.json" as File
end box

== Velge fag ==

User -> HomeC : trykker «LES ANMELDELSER»
HomeC -> Nav : showCourseSelectionForReading(\nreadReviewsButton)
Nav -> SelectC : setOnCourseSelected(\nthis::showReviews)
note right of SelectC : Samme fagvelger som når man\nskriver en anmeldelse. Navigation\nbestemmer hvilken side som åpnes.
Nav -> SelectC : setReviewRepository(\nreviewRepository)
SelectC -> Remote : findAllCourses()\n(i bakgrunnen)
Remote -> CourseC : GET /api/courses
CourseC -> ServerService : getAllCourses()
ServerService -> Handler : findAllCourses()
Handler -> File : leser filen
Handler --> ServerService : emnene, sortert\npå emnekode
ServerService --> CourseC : List<Course>
CourseC --> Remote : 200 OK + emnene
Remote --> SelectC : List<Course>
SelectC --> User : viser emnene i\nnedtrekkslisten

User -> SelectC : velger faget sitt og\ntrykker «GÅ VIDERE»
SelectC -> Nav : onCourseSelected.accept(\nnextButton, course)
Nav -> ReadC : setReviewService(reviewService)\nsetCourse(course)

== Hente anmeldelser ==

ReadC --> User : viser «Henter anmeldelser ...»
ReadC -> Runner : execute(getCourseWithReviews,\nonSuccess, onFailure)
activate Runner
Runner -> ClientService : getCourseWithReviews(course)
ClientService -> Remote : findCourse(courseCode)
Remote -> CourseC : GET /api/courses/{code}
CourseC -> ServerService : findCourse(code)
ServerService -> Handler : findCourse(code)
Handler -> File : leser filen og\nfinner emnet
Handler --> ServerService : Optional<Course>
ServerService --> CourseC : Optional<Course>

alt emnet finnes
    CourseC --> Remote : 200 OK +\nCourseDetailsResponse
    note right of CourseC : Serveren sender bare visningsnavnet:\nnavnet til brukeren, «Anonym» eller\n«Gjest». E-posten sendes ikke.
    Remote --> ClientService : Optional med Course
    ClientService --> Runner : Course med anmeldelser
else emnet finnes ikke
    CourseC --> Remote : 404 Not Found
    Remote --> ClientService : Optional.empty()
    ClientService -> ClientService : new Course(courseCode,\ncourseName)
    ClientService --> Runner : Course uten anmeldelser
end

Runner --> ReadC : onSuccess,\npå JavaFX-tråden
deactivate Runner

== Vise anmeldelser ==

ReadC -> ReadC : henter getAverageRating()\nog getReviews() fra Course
ReadC --> User : viser gjennomsnittet som tall\nog stjerner, antall anmeldelser og\net kort per anmeldelse med navn,\nstjerner og kommentar

note over SelectC, ReadC
  Får klienten ikke kontakt med serveren,
  viser CourseSelectionController «Kunne ikke
  hente emnene. Prøv igjen senere.», og
  ReadReviewsController viser «Kunne ikke lese
  anmeldelsene. Prøv igjen senere.»
end note

@enduml